sequenceDiagram
  participant API as API
  participant SB as Service Bus scan-jobs
  participant W as Worker
  participant OP as Operateur
  API->>SB: scan.requested versioned sessionId=tenantId
  W->>SB: accept tenant session
  W->>W: validate schema/version
  alt contrat invalide ou erreur non recuperable
    W->>SB: dead-letter message
  else traitement OK
    W->>SB: complete message
  end
  OP->>SB: inspect DLQ stats
  alt message rejouable
    OP->>SB: dlq-replay dry-run puis replay
  else message obsolete
    OP->>SB: purge DLQ ou delete via portal
  end
